cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Translate Bench or its results, please cite the version you used."
type: software
title: "Translate Bench"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible benchmark for translation quality, speed and memory across local models and cloud services:
  40 systems in 18 directions between English and nine languages, scored with COMET-22, chrF++ and MetricX-24,
  with item-level scores and the code that recomputes the scores, rankings and intervals from them (speed,
  memory and cost are published measurements, checked for schema and range). Version 1.1 adds 208 hard cases
  from the Last Translation Benchmark and an Overall score that averages COMET-22, the LLM judge's error-free
  share and the hard-case pass rate; the version 1.0 results are unchanged.
authors:
  - alias: takechanman1228
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-27
repository-code: "https://github.com/takechanman1228/translate-bench"
url: "https://github.com/takechanman1228/translate-bench"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - machine translation
  - benchmark
  - evaluation
  - local models
